     <td><para unique="1091411">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091413">SSE4_1</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091415">Sign extend 8 packed 8-bit integers in the low 8 bytes of xmm2/m64 to 8 packed 16-bit integers in xmm1.</para>
