     <td><para unique="1092716">Sign extend 4 packed 32-bit integers in <anchor id="+114730"/>xmm2/m128 to 4 packed 64-bit integers in ymm1 using writemask k1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1092684">EVEX.512.66.0F38.W0 25 /r</para>
      <para unique="1092685">VPMOVSXDQ zmm1 {k1}{z}, ymm2/m256</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1092689">B</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1092691">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1092696">AVX512F </para>
      <para unique="1092697">OR AVX10.1</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1092699">Sign extend 8 packed 32-bit integers in <anchor id="+667983"/>ymm2/m256 to 8 packed 64-bit integers in zmm1 using writemask k1. </para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    </tbody>
   </table>
